<div class="mh-row clearfix">
	<div id="main-content" class="mh-content"><article class="post-wrapper post-199909 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-aew-ppv-reports category-mustreadarticles category-newsticker category-ppv_reports tag-adam-copeland tag-aew tag-aew-full-gear tag-alex-windsor tag-austin-creed tag-bandido tag-brody-king tag-hangman-page tag-harley-cameron tag-ilja-dragunov tag-jake-doyle tag-jamie-hayter tag-kazuchika-okada tag-kofi tag-kris-statlander tag-kyle-fletcher tag-mark-davis tag-matt-jackson tag-nick-jackson tag-swerve-strickland tag-tommaso-ciampa tag-will-ospreay">
	<header class="entry-header">
		<h1 class="entry-title">
			AEW Full Gear results: Powell&#8217;s live review of Will Ospreay vs. Kyle Fletcher for the AEW World Championship, Mercedes Mone vs. Marina Shafir for the AEW Women&#8217;s Championship		</h1><p class="entry-meta">
<span class="entry-meta-date updated"><i class="fa fa-clock-o"></i>November 14, 2026</span></p>
    </header><div class="widget_text post-ad-widget widget_custom_html"><div class="textwidget custom-html-widget"><div id="FreeStarVideoAdContainer">
<div id="freestar-video-parent">
<div id="freestar-video-child"></div>
	</div>
</div>

<!-- Tag ID: prowrestling_incontent_1 -->
<div align="center" data-freestar-ad="__336x280 __336x280" id="prowrestling_incontent_1">
<script data-cfasync="false" type="text/javascript">
    freestar.config.enabled_slots.push({ placementName: "prowrestling_incontent_1", slotId: "prowrestling_incontent_1" });
  </script>
</div></div></div><p class="entry-category">
<span class="entry-category-title">Categories</span><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/category/ppv_reports/aew-ppv-reports/" rel="category tag">AEW PPV Reports</a> <a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/category/mustreadarticles/" rel="category tag">MUST-READ LIST</a> <a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/category/newsticker/" rel="category tag">NEWS TICKER</a> <a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/category/ppv_reports/" rel="category tag">PPV REPORTS</a></p>
	<div class="entry-content">
		<div id="prowr-3946834659" class="prowr-apple-podcast-button-link prowr-entity-placement" style="margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto;text-align: center;" role="region" aria-label="Advertisements"><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/pro-wrestling-boom-podcast/id1365989370" aria-label="SUBSCRIBE IN APPLE PODCASTS"><img decoding="async" src="https://i0.wp.com/prowrestling.net/site/wp-content/uploads/advanced_ads/2019/07/Logo2019_ApplePodcasts_320wide.png?fit=320%2C78&#038;ssl=1" alt="SUBSCRIBE IN APPLE PODCASTS"  srcset="https://i0.wp.com/prowrestling.net/site/wp-content/uploads/advanced_ads/2019/07/Logo2019_ApplePodcasts_320wide.png?w=320&ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/prowrestling.net/site/wp-content/uploads/advanced_ads/2019/07/Logo2019_ApplePodcasts_320wide.png?resize=300%2C73&ssl=1 300w" sizes="(max-width: 320px) 100vw, 320px" width="320" height="78"   /></a></div><p><b>By Jason Powell</b>, ProWrestling.net Editor (<a href="https://twitter.com/prowrestlingnet" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@prowrestlingnet</a>)</p>
<p><b>AEW Full Gear<br />
Phoenix, Arizona, at Mortgage Matchup Center<br />
Aired live on November 14, 2026, on pay-per-view</b></p>
<p>The show opened with a Full Gear video package&#8230; Excalibur, Nigel McGuinness, and Tony Schiavone were on commentary. Excalibur said they would be on the call for the entire night&#8230;</p>
<p>A video package set up the AEW International Championship match&#8230; Adam Copeland made his entrnace while ring announcer Arkady Aura introduced him. Yes, the fans sang his entrance theme after it stopped playing. Kazuchika Okada made his entrance with Don Callis&#8230;</p>
<p><strong>1. Kazuchika Okada (w/Don Callis) vs. Adam Copeland for the AEW International Championship.</strong> The fans cheered loudly before the opening bell. Okada and Copeland met in the middle of the ring and looked at each other, then at the cheering fans, who broke into an &#8220;AEW&#8221; chant followed by a &#8220;F&#8212; Don Callis&#8221; chant.</p>
<div id="prowr-658148996" class="prowr-after-content prowr-entity-placement" role="region" aria-label="Advertisements"><a class="spreaker-player" href="https://www.spreaker.com/show/pwboom" data-resource="show_id=3275525" data-theme="light" data-playlist="show" data-width="100%" data-height="340px">Listen to "Pro Wrestling Boom Podcast" on Spreaker.</a><script async src="https://widget.spreaker.com/widgets.js"></script></div>	</div><div class="widget_text post-ad-widget widget_custom_html"><div class="textwidget custom-html-widget"><!-- Tag ID: prowrestling_incontent_4 -->
<div id="prowrestling_incontent_4" align="center" data-freestar-ad="__336x280 __336x280"><script data-cfasync="false" type="text/javascript">
    freestar.config.enabled_slots.push({ placementName: "prowrestling_incontent_4", slotId: "prowrestling_incontent_4" });
  </script></div></div></div><div class="post-ad-widget widget_text"><h4 class="widget-title">WE VALUE YOUR PRIVACY</h4>			<div class="textwidget"><p><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/our-privacy-policy-at-prowrestling-net/">PRIVACY POLICY INFO HERE</a></p>
</div>
		</div><div class="entry-tags"><span class="tag-title">Topics</span><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/tag/adam-copeland/" rel="tag">adam copeland</a><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/tag/aew/" rel="tag">aew</a><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/tag/aew-full-gear/" rel="tag">aew full gear</a><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/tag/alex-windsor/" rel="tag">alex windsor</a><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/tag/austin-creed/" rel="tag">austin creed</a><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/tag/bandido/" rel="tag">bandido</a><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/tag/brody-king/" rel="tag">brody king</a><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/tag/hangman-page/" rel="tag">hangman page</a><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/tag/harley-cameron/" rel="tag">harley cameron</a><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/tag/ilja-dragunov/" rel="tag">ilja dragunov</a><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/tag/jake-doyle/" rel="tag">jake doyle</a><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/tag/jamie-hayter/" rel="tag">jamie hayter</a><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/tag/kazuchika-okada/" rel="tag">kazuchika okada</a><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/tag/kofi/" rel="tag">kofi</a><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/tag/kris-statlander/" rel="tag">kris statlander</a><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/tag/kyle-fletcher/" rel="tag">kyle fletcher</a><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/tag/mark-davis/" rel="tag">mark davis</a><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/tag/matt-jackson/" rel="tag">matt jackson</a><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/tag/nick-jackson/" rel="tag">nick jackson</a><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/tag/swerve-strickland/" rel="tag">swerve strickland</a><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/tag/tommaso-ciampa/" rel="tag">tommaso ciampa</a><a href="https://prowrestling.net/site/tag/will-ospreay/" rel="tag">will ospreay</a></div>			<div class="mh-share-buttons">
